# CoChem-BASE Strict Air-Gap Constraints
# COCHEM-BENCH FILESYSTEM AIR-GAP POLICY

# 1. Permanently ignore the dynamically generated Artifact Tier
# 2. Absolute blocking of the Artifacts Workspace & Local Compute Overlap
CoChem_Artifacts/
*/CoChem_Artifacts/*
cochem_exec_*/

# 2. Ignore all localized registries and state locks
# 6. Local Registries & States (Prevents cross-machine configuration poisoning)
*config.json
cochem_system_config.json
cochem_audit_log.json
TOPOS_Runtime_State.json
cochem_bench_run_state.jsonl
*.lock

# 3. Block all heavy quantum chemistry and database tensors
# 3. Heavy Databases & Quantum Arrays (Prevents repository bloat)
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.gbw
*.tmp
*.scf
*.densities
*.cube
*.parquet
*.npy
*.npz
*.db
*.sqlite

# 4. Block telemetry and execution logs
# 4. Execution Scratch, Telemetry Logs, & HPC Residue
*.log
*.out
*.err
Logs/
core.*
slurm-*.out
runinfo/
*.parsl
*.chk
*.opt

# 5. Block Python Bytecode & Environments
# 1. Python Cache & Virtual Environments
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.class
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.cochem_env/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv
cochem_*_silo/

# 6. Exception Scoping for CI/CD Pipeline
# 5. User Chemical Inputs (Protects proprietary user data)
*.xyz
*.mol
*.smi
*.pdb
*.cif
!tests/**/*.xyz
